<http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/document> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "SEN0401 chapter 3 - RDODI Stage 3 document"@en ; owl:versionInfo "1.1.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/document/1.1.0> ; rdfs:comment "1.1.0 rewrites every explanation as four to six paragraphs of continuous prose, keeps every concept identifier of 1.0.0 with its parent, and adds the concepts the explanations needed (the checksum, the OpenPGP signature, the reproducible build, the package registry, the Bitcoin block header and its fields, the chain state, the computing foundations and others) found by an audit of the terms used; it also corrects statements of 1.0.0 that the sources no longer support, so MAJOR in the text and MINOR in the structure; numbered MINOR because no identifier was removed."@en ;
